## Phase 3: Backend — New & Updated API Routes

### [NEW] `Server/middleware/auth.cjs`
A reusable JWT middleware to protect admin routes. Since the current app does **not use JWT tokens** (it returns the raw user object and stores it in localStorage), we need to add JWT signing to login responses first:
- `verifyToken(req, res, next)` — validates the JWT from the `Authorization` header.
- `requireRole(...roles)` — checks that the token's role is in the allowed list.

---

### [MODIFY] `Server/routes/authroutes.cjs`
Update all 3 login endpoints (`/login`, `/google-login`) to:
1. Sign and return a **JWT token** containing `{ userId, email, role, name }`.
2. Before signing the token, check: if `email === 'hariiiiii0519@gmail.com'`, force `role = 'super_admin'` and update the DB if needed.
3. Return `{ message, user, token }` instead of just `{ message, user }`.

Also remove the `createDefaultAdmin()` function from `app.cjs` — it is now obsolete.

---

### [NEW] `Server/routes/menuRoutes.cjs`
Public routes for serving menu data to the frontend:

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/menu/categories` | Returns all categories |
| `GET` | `/api/menu/items/:categoryId` | Returns all items for a category |
| `GET` | `/api/menu/all` | Returns full menu (categories + all items) in one call |

---

### [NEW] `Server/routes/adminRoutes.cjs`
Protected routes for the admin dashboard:

| Method | Endpoint | Role Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/admin/request` | Public | Submit an admin access request |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/requests` | `super_admin` | Get all pending/past requests |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/requests/:id/approve` | `super_admin` | Approve request, set role on User |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/requests/:id/reject` | `super_admin` | Reject a request |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/stats` | `admin`, `super_admin` | Analytics: orders, revenue, peak times |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/menu` | `admin`, `super_admin`, `staff` | Fetch all menu items for the dashboard table |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/menu/:itemId` | `admin`, `super_admin` | Update stock and/or price for one item |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/orders` | `admin`, `super_admin`, `staff` | Paginated list of all customer orders |

---

### [MODIFY] `Server/app.cjs`
Register the new route files:
```js
const menuRoutes = require('./routes/menuRoutes.cjs');
const adminRoutes = require('./routes/adminRoutes.cjs');

app.use('/api/menu', menuRoutes);
app.use('/api/admin', adminRoutes);
```

